e client.\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-580-\\n--\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-672-`SourceSectionReader` and `MaterialsSectionReader` should preserve the existing\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-673-section envelope pattern. Active lists exclude detached rows; process materials\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md:674:use the active-source resolver to combine project and process scopes. If an\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-675-enrichment lookup fails, the reader returns durable source identity with\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-676-`entryStatus: degraded` or a section-level source error only when the whole\\n--\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-679-## Active Source Resolution\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-680-\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md:681:The active-source resolver is the central design answer for process-scoped\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-682-shadowing. It affects the process work surface and environment working-set\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-683-planning; it does not make every project-scoped source automatically current\\n--\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-709-   process only.\\ndocs/spec-build/v2/epics/06--source-attachments-and-canonical-source-management/tech-design.md-710-7. 